; if-B-agree-06 - expression matrix, AmiBlitz3 case of
; tests/corpus/tests-exprmatrix/if-B-agree-06.bas: 30 of its 56 cells,
; the 25 AmiBlitz3 refuses left out, 1 If on a folded Float constant
; left out (AmiBlitz3 tests d1, #1187)
